OL,3,ADWP confirms cyber attack forced
OL,4,Apension and benefits systems offline
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Work and Pensions
OL,7,Fhas confirmed it has been the subject
OL,8,Fof a cyber attack, after what it
OL,9,Finitially described as a "cyber
OL,10,Fincident" on Friday
OL,12,FOn Friday, the department said it had
OL,13,Ftaken pension, universal credit and Pip
OL,14,Fservices offline as a "precaution"
OL,16,FDowning Street earlier said there was
OL,17,Fno suggestion personal data has been
OL,18,Flost
OL,20,FRegular benefit and pension payments
OL,21,Fare not affected and will be paid as
OL,22,Fnormal, the department says
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
