OL,3,ADozens killed as Myanmar military
OL,4,Astrikes hit wedding venue and school
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Thursday at least 20 civilians were
OL,7,Fkilled, including students, young monks
OL,8,Fand teachers, when an air strike hit a
OL,9,Fschool at In Yon village, in central
OL,10,FMyanmar's Magway region where
OL,11,Fresistance forces are active, according
OL,12,Fto Myanmar's exiled National Unity
OL,13,FGovernment (NUG).
OL,15,FMyanmar's military-led government has
OL,16,Fnot commented on the strikes.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
